{
  "_comment": [
    "Example `<workdir>/crustify/artifacts/schedule.json`: the campaign's waves and",
    "batches. Planning appends waves after the highest index, and their `index` is",
    "their permanent id, not their position: `todo` waves run in the order of",
    "`depends_on.scheduled`, the lowest index first among those ready at once. Each",
    "batch's id is wave-<index>/batch-<index>, which names its branch and worktree.",
    "`status` and `commits` record progress as the work launches and lands. A",
    "`wrap` or `port` batch's task.json carries its kind as `objective`, its",
    "items, its batch fields and the run fields. Wave 2 reviews wave 1; wave 3 is a",
    "wave of no module, planned from a few named items. Homes follow the coding",
    "conventions: crustify/rust/<repo>/<link-unit>/, here for a repo named widgets.",
    "An independent illustration: it is not a schedule for templates/modules.json."
  ],
